# promise: #855
# Open Task Manager given Chrome's ⇧⎋ in Settings ▸ Shortcuts (keybindings.json) opens it from a page that has the
# keyboard. Arc has no shortcut for it and Cra keeps none by default; before, Settings ▸ Shortcuts couldn't record
# ⇧⎋ (Esc stopped the recording, whatever was held).
budget rss=900 stalls50=20
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true}
seed keybindings.json {"taskManager":[{"key":"\u001b","modifiers":131072}]}
pace 0.5

cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=front
expect-log GET /page\.html\?n=front
wait 2
cra://debug?key=%1B,53,131072&page=1
expect-log task manager: opened from the page in front
